  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Proj Management Procedures &amp; Opportunities for Environmentally &amp; Socially Sustainable Procurement on Transport Inves. Projs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All transport agencies need to manage their contracts but many lack the tools to do this effectively. The lack of adequate systems makes monitoring of progress challenging, and significant resources are often used to meet the monitoring requirements of the World Bank and other IFIs. The project would assess the viability of adopting existing commercial off the shelf software applications for the purpose of managing projects.  The objective of the Grant is to (1) strengthen Tonga#s Ministry of Transport#s (MoT) ability to better manage transport projects (land, sea and air) and (2) to enable the MoT to implement Environmentally and Socially Sustainable Procurement (ESRP) on transport-related projects in Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
